## 2. Side‑by‑Side Comparison

| Feature | Namsan Tower | Gyeongbokgung Palace |
|---------|--------------|----------------------|
| **Location** | Namsan Mountain, central Seoul | 161, Sajik‑ro, Jongno‑gu, Seoul |
| **Best Time to Visit** | Early morning or late evening for light‑and‑shadow views | Mid‑morning (guard ceremony starts at 10 AM) |
| **Accessibility** | Cable‑car + stairs; wheelchair‑accessible observation deck | Public bus & subway (Line 3, Gyeongbokgung Station) |
